			title: "The World Has Moved On"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001001"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0002: Reclamation Units]"
				""
				"Your kit holds one &bMk I Reclamation Generator&r. Place it and it slowly pulls cobblestone in from the void."
				"No power needed at this grade, and no, NCP will not be issuing you a second one."
				""
				"&aRight-click&r it to collect a stack, &aleft-click&r for a single block. It holds what you don't take."
				"Later, a hopper or pipe underneath keeps it emptied while you are away."
				"&7Everything else (gravel, sand, dust, glass) starts as this cobblestone."
			]
			id: "504F530000001002"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F530000003002"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Matter from nothing (slowly)"
			tasks: [{
				count: 64L
				id: "504F530000002002"
				item: "minecraft:cobblestone"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Reclamation Mk I"
			x: 3.0d
			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001009"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0003: Hydration Policy]"
				""
				"You have a &bthirst&r bar. The island's spring never runs dry, but its water is &cdirty&r."
				""
				"&aStep one:&r fill one of your new glass bottles at the spring (right-click the water with it): &cdirty water&r."
				"&7Do not drink it. NCP reminds you that dehydration is not covered by your contract, and neither is dysentery."
			]
			id: "504F530000001003"
			rewards: [{
				id: "504F530000003003"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Thirst, part one"
			tasks: [{
				id: "504F530000002003"
				item: "toughasnails:dirty_water_bottle"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Water Is Life"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001003"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0012: Purification]"
				""
				"&aStep two:&r place the bottle of dirty water on the kiosk's old campfire. After half a minute it is &bpurified&r."
				"Purified water is safe to drink. Boil a few: you will be thirsty again soon."
				""
				"Later, a &bWater Purifier&r does this much faster (it needs copper)."
			]
			id: "504F53000000100D"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F530000003012"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Thirst, part two"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
