				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Boil It"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001001"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0006: Food Security]"
				""
				"There is no farmland to spare on a floating rock, so we grow food in &bBotany Pots&r."
				""
				"&aHow:&r place the pot on solid ground, put a &bdirt&r block in it (from the welcome memo), then a seed."
				"Wait, and right-click to harvest. Later, a &bhopper botany pot&r over a chest harvests on its own."
			]
