		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001006"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0007: Nutrition]"
				""
				"Eating the same meal every day keeps you alive. Eating &bmany different foods&r makes you stronger:"
				"every few new foods you try grants you an extra heart, permanently."
				""
				"&aNo kitchen needed:&r a &bGarden Salad&r (bowl, tomato, lettuce) and a &bVegetable Broth&r"
				"(bowl, tomato, onion, a bottle of purified water) are crafted by hand. Bread, tomato and lettuce make a &bGarden Sandwich&r."
			]
