			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0013: Your First GregTech Tool]"
				""
				"Hammering gravel sometimes leaves a &bflint&r behind. Flint and a block of stone (smelt cobblestone) make a &bflint mortar&r."
				""
				"The mortar grinds things in the crafting grid: gravel into flint, flint into flint dust, sand into quartz sand."
				"It wears out. Every GregTech operator keeps a spare."
			]
			id: "504F53000000100E"
