		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001002"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0011: Manual Reclamation]"
				""
				"No iron, no machines, no problem. Build a &bReclamation Hammer&r from cobblestone and sticks."
				""
				"&aPlace a block and break it with the hammer:&r cobblestone becomes gravel, gravel becomes sand, sand becomes &bdust&r."
				"Two dust and a water bottle make clay, and clay makes more botany pots."
				"The hammer wears out, so build a spare. Work over solid ground: this island is all you have."
				""
				"&7Slow? Yes. Character-building? NCP's lawyers say yes."
			]
			id: "504F53000000100B"
